; implies_sample_register: IMPLIES on a sample register raises TypeMismatch.
;
; spec/xqvm/SPEC.md's Faults table: a model-only opcode applied to a sample
; register raises TypeMismatch. IMPLIES writes QUBO terms, so it is
; model-only. Its charge is paid first and the default budget covers it, so
; the type check decides.

PUSH 4
BSMX r0          ; a binary sample, not a model
PUSH 0
PUSH 1
PUSH 1           ; i, j, penalty
IMPLIES r0
HALT
